# The versioning stage never completes a local write, which then never decides.
MODULE: WriteDecidesVersioningStalls
TARGET: WriteDecides
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the versioning stage hangs on local writes
PERTURBS: RunVersioning

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "Chain" /\ Chain(reg)[idx] = "V"
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "Chain" /\ Chain(reg)[idx] = "V" /\ origin = "System"
--- END
